#: /src/sites/twitch-twilight/modules/chat/index.js:389
#, icu-message-format, md-text
msgid "setting.chat.filtering.block.callout_types.description"
msgstr ""
"This filter allows you to remove callouts of specific types from Twitch "
"chat. Callouts are special messages that can be pinned to the bottom of "
"chat and often have associated actions, like claiming a drop or sharing "
"your resubscription."

#: /src/sites/twitch-twilight/modules/chat/index.js:414
