msgctxt "FFZ Control Center"
msgid "setting.chat.filtering.block.message_types.description"
msgstr ""
"This filter allows you to remove all messages of a certain type from Twitch "
"chat. It can be used to filter system messages, such as Hosts or Raids. "
"Some types, such as moderation actions, cannot be blocked to prevent chat "
"functionality from breaking."

