msgstr ""
"These settings allow you to highlight messages in chat based on their "
"contents. Setting priorities on rules allows you to determine which "
"highlight color should be applied if a message matches multiple rules. "
"Rules with a higher priority take priority over rules with lower "
"priorities.\n"
"\n"
"You can also create a rule that removes highlights from messages, "
"preventing lower priority rules from highlighting them, by setting a color "
"with an alpha value of zero. Example: `#00000000`"

